{"id":"627069","name":"香酥小油条","author":"糖糖食味记","authorId":"12729364","desc":"","cover":"images/627069/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"2g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"牛奶或水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备150g面粉。","img":"images/627069/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入事先准备好的发酵粉、盐和鸡蛋。","img":"images/627069/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入适量牛奶和成面絮状。","img":"images/627069/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"上手揉成湿润一点的面团。盖上保鲜膜，醒发至两倍大。","img":"images/627069/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"醒好的面团不要揉搓，轻轻摊成面饼，切成长条状。","img":"images/627069/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"这个样子。","img":"images/627069/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将面条重叠在一起，用筷子从中间按压一下，再两边收口。","img":"images/627069/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大概成这个样子。","img":"images/627069/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"油温七成热下锅。","img":"images/627069/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"注意翻面，炸至表面金黄酥脆捞出。","img":"images/627069/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627069/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627069/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627069/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627069/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627069/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}